          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abarira Mose ati: “Duga aho ndi ngaha ku musozi ugumeho, nanje nzoguha ibisate vy’amabuye nanditseko Ivyagezwe n’amabwirizwa kugira ngo uzovyigishe abantu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Mose ava hasi, ajana na Yosuwa uwamufasha, aduga ku musozi w’Imana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarira ba bakuru ati: “Muturindirire hano gushika tugarutse. Aroni na Huri bari kumwe namwe, nihagira uwugira ico apfa n’uwundi muri mwebwe, baze bitware kuri bo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose amaze kuduga kuri wa musozi, igipfungu gica kirawutwikira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ubwiza bw’Imana burururuka kuri uwo musozi Sinayi, ca gipfungu kimara imisi itandatu kiwupfutse. Ku musi ugira indwi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ahamagara Mose ari muri ca gipfungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku Bisirayeli bari ku ntango y’uwo musozi, ubwo bwiza bw’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " bwari bumeze nk’umuriro utongora kuri uwo musozi hejuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose na we yinjira muri ico gipfungu aduga kuri uwo musozi, amarayo imisi mirongo ine n’amajoro mirongo ine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
